Resetting a context's permission overrides does not undo a view's own rules.

patches/1046 made a reset outrank every view rule older than it, so a CDP
client clearing permissions for one view silently lifted another view's explicit
denial. A reset only clears overrides: a view's rule loses only to an override
written after it.

